## Section 2 - Major Version Watchlist
| Package | Current | Latest Major | First Detected | Notes |
|---------|---------|--------------|----------------|-------|
| vite | ^7.3.5 | 8.1.0 | 2026-06-18 | [Updated] Breaking: Single Rust-based bundler (Rolldown) for both dev and prod. Renames `build.rollupOptions` to `build.rolldownOptions`. Integrated Lightning CSS and Oxc transforms. |
| typescript | ~5.9.3 | 6.0.3 | 2026-06-18 | [Updated] Breaking: `rootDir` defaults to project root. `types` defaults to `[]` (explicit opt-in). `strict` is on by default. `target: es5` is deprecated. |
| @types/node | ^24.13.2 | 26.0.1 | 2026-06-18 | [Updated] Breaking: Temporal API stable and enabled by default. Removes internal `_stream_*` modules. `Iterator.concat` and `Map.getOrInsert` added. |
| pnpm | >=10.0.0 | 11.9.0 | 2026-06-18 | [Updated] Breaking: Pure ESM distribution (Node 22+ required). Most settings moved from `.npmrc` to `pnpm-workspace.yaml`. `allowBuilds` replaces legacy build flags. |
| vue-router | ^4.6.4 | 5.1.0 | 2026-06-18 | [Updated] Breaking: Merges `unplugin-vue-router` for native file-based routing. Devtools API upgraded to v8 (IIFE build affected). No code changes for V4 users not using file-based routing. |
| jsdom | ^24.1.3 | 29.1.1 | 2026-06-18 | [Updated] Breaking: Node.js v22.13.0+ required. CSSOM overhauled with native Rust-backed implementation. Upgraded internal dependency tree. |
| rollup-plugin-visualizer | ^6.0.11 | 7.0.1 | 2026-06-18 | [Updated] Breaking: ESM-only distribution. Drops Node <22. Added Rolldown support and new LLM-friendly Markdown report template. |
| dependency-cruiser | ^17.4.3 | 18.0.0 | 2026-06-26 | [Updated] Breaking: Drops support for Node.js 20 and 25. Internal dependency updates and deterministic summary fixes. Verified compatible with Vite 8. |
